    "For the five-plus-three case, retain exact original legacy input filenames and five-hint ordering; the proper prose hint still contributes to the total eight hints.",
    "Calibrate candidate and refresh content-read observations against actual reads; candidate oversize refusal must not open its body. Saved refresh must retain original lint ID/source hash and perform no new source-content reads."
  ],
